{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>市場關注中東局勢發展，原油期貨價格漲跌互見。</p><p></p><p>紐約期油收市報97.97美元一桶，升2.88美元，升幅百分之3。倫敦期油收市報105.92美元一桶，跌14美仙，跌幅百分之0.1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.293150+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:37:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:46.985408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:46.985408+00:00","content_hash":"a76153435366bebb79a4a95709017916356e60d4e907b056231e7ef00040b2ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}